{"schema_version":1,"guid":"7f1fefdb-1527-4c18-ac4f-12d0d430029b","apple_collection_id":"1566089134","show":"Bedtime Stories For Adult's","titel":"Hot and heavy: Adult version of Snow white and the seven Dwarfs","audio":{"url":"https://anchor.fm/s/598afb34/podcast/play/37768445/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2021-07-24%2F1d4b465790d806f06bd93f7c5f82453f.m4a","user_agent":"PodcastsAM/1.0 (+https://amapps.app)","groesse":23050857,"format":"m4a","geprueft_am":"2026-11-19T13:35:38+00:00"},"faehigkeiten":{"clips":false,"clips_aac":true,"clips_suche":false,"range":true,"kapitel":true,"dynamik":"unbestimmt","grund":"Dynamik weder belegt noch ausgeschlossen: keine Merkmale gefunden, aber eine unveraenderte Wiederholungsprobe beweist nichts; M4A: Ausschnitte nur als AAC-Bloecke (clips_aac) - eine App ohne ADTS-Umverpackung zeigt keine"},"einzeiler":"A humorous adult twist on the classic Snow White fairy tale featuring seven men.","kurzfassung":"The host presents an adult-themed version of Snow White where the main character, Bunny Love, organizes a week-long dating experiment with seven men at her playhouse. After putting the contestants through various tests of entertainment and intimacy, she establishes a permanent arrangement where all men get equal attention. The story concludes with safety precautions and a warm thank you to the listeners.","stichpunkte":["The host returns after a brief hiatus due to a demanding career, expressing gratitude for growing listener numbers.","The episode features an adult retelling of Snow White with a protagonist named Bunny Love.","Bunny Love creates an online dating profile and sifts through fifty messages to select fifteen candidates.","The selection is further narrowed down to seven men based on their conversational skills and ability to prevent boredom.","The chosen seven men are invited to stay at Bunny Love's playhouse for a seven-day speed dating event.","Contestant Dajon impresses Bunny Love with his intimacy skills during a hot tub date, raising the stakes for the other men.","After the initial week, Bunny Love proposes an arrangement where she visits all seven men regularly to be treated like royalty.","All men are required to undergo health testing before any physical activities commence.","The host wraps up the episode by thanking the audience and promising a return in the upcoming month."],"kapitel":[{"titel":"Introduction and Listener Appreciation","start":4.72},{"titel":"Introducing Bunny Love and Her Dating Profile","start":272.4},{"titel":"Selecting the Seven Men","start":420.88},{"titel":"The Seven-Day Playhouse Experiment","start":625.84},{"titel":"Hot Tub Romance and Raising the Stakes","start":959.48},{"titel":"The Final Arrangement and Safety First","start":1108.84},{"titel":"Closing Thoughts and Sign-Off","start":1330.34}],"clips":[{"hook":"Doing this purely for fun","start":47.322,"ende":73.352,"laenge":26.03,"byte_start":1003971,"byte_ende":1420521,"bytes":416551,"range_header":"bytes=1003971-1420521","vorlauf_s":0.0696,"inhalt_start":47.392,"anker_sha256":"6a7d339431ef1dab2b123b3bcb48b67d529ee407308c3f3dd4e49b33f014ec2c","anker_ende_sha256":"328c22212012d1363017eb6aae6770f482720931842c0a2b926d7fef226147b8","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"The host explains that she refuses to stress over release schedules because this project is a personal hobby pursued purely for enjoyment.","aac":{"profil":2,"samplerate_index":4,"kanaele":2,"bloecke":[359,357,370,364,360,373,367,371,370,372,447,460,431,396,366,354,388,382,334,342,356,351,346,350,353,352,353,351,356,363,361,366,359,360,370,371,371,389,363,375,365,371,370,379,484,445,435,316,349,333,354,341,402,354,350,353,369,353,349,365,403,478,371,370,379,373,364,341,336,367,446,421,401,337,319,340,317,398,441,425,378,351,335,361,358,394,360,357,356,354,327,353,401,372,577,382,342,360,358,352,355,363,462,449,423,362,333,362,328,404,403,332,368,349,325,337,334,343,333,349,353,373,363,359,368,367,387,381,464,380,352,370